Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- Key repeated rows by their place in the list, so two rows with the same text both draw and keep their own state.
- The rolled price was rounded to a whole number, so 19.99 showed as 20; it now keeps the price's own decimals, up to two.

